00:18:04,974 --> 00:18:06,511
Hey, Sakuya, Alicia,

256
00:18:06,594 --> 00:18:10,311
wasn't the point of you guys getting
together to make a try for the world tree?

257
00:18:10,394 --> 00:18:12,614
Ultimately, yes, that was our goal.

258
00:18:13,114 --> 00:18:16,871
If you're okay with it and it's no
trouble, we'd like to go with you.

259
00:18:16,954 --> 00:18:19,660
We're kind of in a hurry
to get there, though.

260
00:18:23,034 --> 00:18:24,774
Well, I can't see why not.

261
00:18:25,034 --> 00:18:28,446
In fact, the truth is, we'd
be grateful to have you along.

262
00:18:28,554 --> 00:18:31,201
But why are you in such
a hurry to get there?

263
00:18:34,394 --> 00:18:35,629
She's not in a hurry.

264
00:18:36,054 --> 00:18:38,751
I'm the one who has to get
to the top of the tree.

265
00:18:38,834 --> 00:18:41,874
I think someone I know is
up there, waiting for me.

266
00:18:43,074 --> 00:18:43,904
Hmm.

267
00:18:43,987 --> 00:18:45,434
Is it Oberon, the Fairy King?

268
00:18:46,654 --> 00:18:47,484
No.

269
00:18:47,567 --> 00:18:48,397
It's not him.

270
00:18:49,254 --> 00:18:51,607
It's someone I can't reach in real life.

271
00:18:52,794 --> 00:18:54,974
But in here, I might be able to.

272
00:18:55,414 --> 00:18:59,091
We want to help, but storming the tree
is going to take some time to set up.

273
00:18:59,174 --> 00:19:01,511
We've got to gear up the
raiding party and stuff.

274
00:19:01,594 --> 00:19:04,894
And that'll take us way
more than a few days. I see.

275
00:19:06,414 --> 00:19:07,371
Never mind then.

276
00:19:07,454 --> 00:19:09,591
I don't want to raid the tree like you.

277
00:19:09,674 --> 00:19:12,231
I just want to get to the base
of it as soon as possible.

278
00:19:12,314 --> 00:19:13,174
So it's cool.

279
00:19:13,334 --> 00:19:14,291
We'll figure it out.

280
00:19:14,374 --> 00:19:15,734
Oh, by the way...

281
00:19:17,614 --> 00:19:21,143
Maybe this'll help you guys get
some new gear for your raid.

282
00:19:26,354 --> 00:19:27,184
Whoa!

283
00:19:27,267 --> 00:19:28,354
Saffia, look! Check it out!

284
00:19:31,134 --> 00:19:33,814
A hundred thousand pieces of mithril yuld?

285
00:19:34,494 --> 00:19:35,491
You don't want it?

286
00:19:35,574 --> 00:19:38,171
You could build a castle
on Prime Land with this.

287
00:19:38,254 --> 00:19:39,136
No, it's yours.

288
00:19:39,434 --> 00:19:40,846
I don't need it anymore.

289
00:19:41,034 --> 00:19:42,194
You are so awesome!

290
00:19:42,494 --> 00:19:45,591
With this bag of loot, we've got
just about enough for new gear!

291
00:19:45,674 --> 00:19:47,674
We'll get ready as fast as we can.

292
00:19:47,894 --> 00:19:50,511
When we're set to go,
we'll message you, okay?

293
00:19:50,594 --> 00:19:51,814
Yeah, you got it.

294
00:19:54,994 --> 00:19:55,854
Thanks, guys!

295
00:19:56,114 --> 00:19:57,232
We'll be seeing ya!

296
00:20:02,974 --> 00:20:06,814
I don't know about you, but I
can't believe you pulled that off.

297
00:20:12,274 --> 00:20:16,514
Oh, honestly, I thought I told
you no more flirting, Daddy.

298
00:20:17,474 --> 00:20:19,594
But I wasn't flirting with anyone.

299
00:20:19,954 --> 00:20:23,791
When those girls were clinging to you, I
noticed that your heart rate increased.

300
00:20:23,874 --> 00:20:24,704
I'm a guy.

301
00:20:24,787 --> 00:20:27,421
That's what happens when
girls get too close.

302
00:20:28,014 --> 00:20:30,271
Seriously, what about me? I'm a girl.

303
00:20:30,354 --> 00:20:31,589
Isn't that a problem?

304
00:20:32,134 --> 00:20:34,454
No, you seem pretty safe to me, Leafa.

305
00:20:34,754 --> 00:20:36,048
What do you mean safe?

306
00:20:39,234 --> 00:20:43,891
I think what she means is most of the time
you don't really seem much like a girl.

307
00:20:43,974 --> 00:20:44,831
Okay, whoa!

308
00:20:44,914 --> 00:20:46,554
Say that again, I dare you!

309
00:20:46,874 --> 00:20:49,511
No, like, like you're
easy to get along with.

310
00:20:49,594 --> 00:20:50,971
I meant it in a good way.

311
00:20:51,054 --> 00:20:52,734
Yeah, come on!

312
00:20:52,934 --> 00:20:55,251
We still got a ways to
go before we get to Arun.

313
00:20:55,334 --> 00:20:56,991
The sun's starting to go down.

314
00:20:57,074 --> 00:20:59,194
Okay, I'm coming. Wait up!

315
00:21:00,034 --> 00:21:27,897
.

316
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:30,054
One, three, two, three, two, nine.

317
00:21:34,734 --> 00:21:38,334
Kirito, I promise you, I won't give up.

318
00:22:05,554 --> 00:22:06,384
I'm going to push it up.

319
00:22:06,467 --> 00:22:10,374
Highly highly out of this hand.

320
00:22:10,634 --> 00:22:16,174
I will lift it up.

321
00:22:16,434 --> 00:22:18,171
I will sing again.

322
00:22:18,254 --> 00:22:20,211
I'm so

323
00:22:20,294 --> 00:22:27,294
proud

324
00:22:32,914 --> 00:22:35,054
of you.

325
00:22:48,254 --> 00:22:50,534
I'm already late now.

326
00:22:51,694 --> 00:22:53,834
I am not saying any other words.

327
00:22:55,534 --> 00:22:58,154
Everything is so, all of you next time?

328
00:22:58,834 --> 00:23:01,069
The end, the beginning, the beginning.

329
00:23:03,654 --> 00:23:06,871
I am high, high, high.

330
00:23:06,954 --> 00:23:08,894
I am holding my hand.

331
00:23:10,034 --> 00:23:11,269
The light is the aim,

332
00:23:12,394 --> 00:23:17,514
I am low, I am high.

333
00:23:35,234 --> 00:23:38,514
Next time, the truth about Alfheim.
